s4::dchrprimprim |- ( ( N e. NN /\ X e. ( Base ` ( DChr ` N ) ) ) -> ( ( N DChrCond X ) DChrCond ( N DChrPrim X ) ) = ( N DChrCond X ) )
s5::dchrcondeq1 |- ( ( N e. NN /\ X e. ( Base ` ( DChr ` N ) ) ) -> ( X = ( 0g ` ( DChr ` N ) ) <-> ( N DChrCond X ) = 1 ) )
