s8:s7,s6:jca |- ( ( N e. NN /\ X e. ( Base ` ( DChr ` N ) ) ) -> ( ( ( ( N DChrCond X ) e. NN /\ ( N DChrPrim X ) e. ( Base ` ( DChr ` ( N DChrCond X ) ) ) ) /\ ( ( N DChrCond X ) DChrCond ( N DChrPrim X ) ) = ( N DChrCond X ) ) /\ if ( X = ( 0g ` ( DChr ` N ) ) , 1 , 0 ) = if ( ( N DChrCond X ) = 1 , 1 , 0 ) ) )
